  <p id="c-hanshu-053-zixiang-han:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-hanshu-053-zixiang-han:p001:m0000" ref="yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAH">臨江閔王榮</persName>以孝景前四年為皇太子，四歲廢為臨江王。</p>
  <p id="c-hanshu-053-zixiang-han:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">中尉郅都簿責訊王，王恐，自殺。葬藍田</p>
